---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Command from '../components/Command.astro';
---

<Shell
  tab="about"
  title="About | Giovanni Rossini"
  description="DevOps Lead at AmplifyMD, working on CI/CD, AWS and FedRAMP, HIPAA and SOC 2 compliance."
>
  <Command cmd="cat about.txt" label="About" id="about" level={1}>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I lead the DevOps team at AmplifyMD, a healthtech company. I own the CI/CD platform and the
        AWS infrastructure behind it, and drive the FedRAMP, HIPAA and SOC 2 work that comes with
        handling patient data.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started in IT support in 2015 and have worked through sysadmin, SRE and platform roles
        since. On the side I build small tools for the parts of infrastructure work that are easy
        to get wrong, like reading a plan before you apply it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Command>
</Shell>
